,{"id":1651930,"name":"Lola García","role":"Recepcionista Hospital"},{"id":1356494,"name":"Fernando Iglesias","role":"Swimmer (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/icj86ValRJ7xrdb7CcvK635SBBc.jpg"},{"id":954,"name":"Marisa Paredes","role":"Espectadora (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/71esuRUCyeSyib35mTFPkR24zH7.jpg"},{"id":953,"name":"Cecilia Roth","role":"Espectadora (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4icHsZvHy0ZnDGF2kovjNLuDQEM.jpg"},{"id":6536,"name":"Loles León","role":"Talk show host","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tGzS0iV3K4fTGIiOb1UJRpMOL8u.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Parla con lei","overview":"Strani scherzi del destino. Marco e Benigno, due spettatori della pièce teatrale Café Muller si sfiorano con gli occhi, coinvolti nella stessa commozione. Si ritrovano qualche mese dopo nella clinica dove Benigno lavora come infermiere. Marco è lì per accudire la fidanzata in coma..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Talk to Her","overview":"Two men share an odd friendship while they care for two women who are both in deep comas."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"Hable con ella","overview":"Benigno, un enfermero, y Marco, un escritor maduro, coinciden en un espectáculo de Pina Bausch, en el Cafe Müller. En el escenario, dos mujeres con los ojos cerrados y los brazos extendidos se mueven al compás de \"The Fairy Queen\" de Henry Purcell. La emoción de Marco es tal que rompe a llorar. A Benigno le gustaría decirle que a él también le emociona el espectáculo, pero no se atreve. Meses más tarde, los dos hombres vuelven a encontrarse en la clínica privada \"El Bosque\", donde Benigno trabaja. Lydia, la novia de Marco, torera de profesión, ha sufrido una cogida y está en coma. Benigno cuida de otra mujer también en estado de coma: Alicia, una estudiante de ballet. El reencuentro entre Marco y Benigno es el comienzo de una intensa amistad. Dentro de la clínica, la vida de los cuatro personajes fluye en todas las direcciones, pasado, presente y futuro, arrastrando a los cuatro a un destino insospechado."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ohnunWwTfPsqiixTPbGQP4kyUzc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rknvDtxOe1uqLX0EFWLHIQxRXcJ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"es-ES","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7E0ZukUMnSVHvGwHVBF1iOP86RE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7E0ZukUMnSVHvGwHVBF1iOP86RE.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fWDbQlOWOqjR5jZm98KjGyYmUOw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fWDbQlOWOqjR5jZm98KjGyYmUOw.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pa4hvcC78QwDZlT7a6DQe2ISVt3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pa4hvcC78QwDZlT7a6DQe2ISVt3.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b6PWrMT3TET6s8jaIboa2sr8ZYK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b6PWrMT3TET6s8jaIboa2sr8ZYK.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p8ilqBhIT5YnKOf6hBPEVPc8uGS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p8ilqBhIT5YnKOf6hBPEVPc8uGS.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ePERgbqEI1sYTzSVIHDYD9MJ1IS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ePERgbqEI1sYTzSVIHDYD9MJ1IS.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5XHHxzx3qWowda7xWUUx7SAkAcW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5XHHxzx3qWowda7xWUUx7SAkAcW.jpg","language":"es"